  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As the title says Client will keep loading URLs from the Queue until the queue is empty even after the world change. This results in errors in the console and can be used to permanently make the user have near 0 FPS until restart if a malicious world creator uses this.\n\nVRChat Client should Empty the queue on world change and also probably shouldn't allow >1K Items in the queue",
